/P 55 0 R
/E (Developed a comprehensive digital waybill management system for Outrite Africa, a logistics company, transforming their entirely paper-based operations into a modern, cloud-based solution. The system was built as a custom WordPress plugin and seamlessly integrated into their existing website hosted on domains.co.za, providing secure access to authorized users while maintaining complete data separation between company staff and external clients.)
