101 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 56 0 R
/E (A production-ready WordPress plugin that completely eliminated paper-based processes while improving accuracy and efficiency across all logistics operations. The system automates previously manual tasks like generating unique waybill numbers, calculating volume mass and weights and formatting professional PDFs while adding capabilities that were impossible with paper such as real-time overdue tracking, instant Excel exports and 24/7 client access to shipment data. Built with robust security measures including role-based permissions, SQL injection prevention and file validation the platform supports unlimited concurrent users without number conflicts or data loss. The solution integrates Google Maps API for intelligent address entry and features an intuitive interface that requires minimal training, ensuring smooth adoption across users with varying technical abilities.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
